new_password.description:
New admin password. Structural minimum is one character;
Django's `AUTH_PASSWORD_VALIDATORS` enforce real strength
rules and surface their failures as `400`.

authentication_method.description:
MSSQL-only. Any non-default value requires `connection=MSSQL`.
`Kerberos` requires `username` in UPN form (`user@REALM`);
`Kerberos / NTLM` accepts UPN or `DOMAIN\user`.

